{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sylvantia is an indie creature collector. The whole forest gets controlled by an ancient god, which won\u00b4t let anybody escape it\u00b4s fangs. So the only viable solution is to defeat the ancient god and free the forest of the obscure curse. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore and hunt through the mysterious parts of the forest.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2464510/extras/3a08a887c0b2cb479ba620c76d9ce2a5.poster.avif?t=1759482687\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2464510/extras/3a08a887c0b2cb479ba620c76d9ce2a5.webm?t=1759482687\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2464510/extras/3a08a887c0b2cb479ba620c76d9ce2a5.mp4?t=1759482687\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight your way through the forest and its wildlife.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2464510/extras/d90fe85db69a661062ee6a48a05416cf.poster.avif?t=1759482687\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2464510/extras/d90fe85db69a661062ee6a48a05416cf.webm?t=1759482687\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2464510/extras/d90fe85db69a661062ee6a48a05416cf.mp4?t=1759482687\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tame different Antia's to support you. You might even be lucky enough to encounter prismatic ones.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2464510/extras/b8b1a9820a9e5fed08b306465b6142c8.poster.avif?t=1759482687\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2464510/extras/b8b1a9820a9e5fed08b306465b6142c8.webm?t=1759482687\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2464510/extras/b8b1a9820a9e5fed08b306465b6142c8.mp4?t=1759482687\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Oppose the ancient gods and free yourself.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2464510/extras/64a0d672a4e232337b7d37143eea6c6d.poster.avif?t=1759482687\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2464510/extras/64a0d672a4e232337b7d37143eea6c6d.webm?t=1759482687\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2464510/extras/64a0d672a4e232337b7d37143eea6c6d.mp4?t=1759482687\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sylvantia features</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >over 160 different Antia\u00b4s for you to collect, some might only be found in water or deep caves</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >crystal skills &amp; shards to create unique fight situations  </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >collectibles   </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >an emerging story </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >many achievements for you to accomplish</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Promotional artwork by Acalysth</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2464510?